<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edges up to 1.8510 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edges up to 1.8510 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged up to 1.8510 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.8620 at the previous session.</p>
<p>					  April 8	    April 7</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar		1.8510	     1.8620</p>
<p> Volume traded			$26.09 million	 $3.31 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 244 9150</p>
